{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/111093","id":2876090518,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc6rbaiW","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/111093","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/111093.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/111093.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/111093","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/111093/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/111093/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/111093/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/c4f742ea753ff0601be68c5ffa3a6b399546a746","number":111093,"state":"open","locked":false,"title":"Add ability to use 3D physics engine in 2D","user":{"login":"rburing","id":229837,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyOTgzNw==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/229837?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/rburing","html_url":"https://github.com/rburing","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rburing/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rburing/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rburing/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rburing/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rburing/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rburing/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rburing/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rburing/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rburing/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"Adds a new option for the 2D physics engine:\r\n\r\n<img width=\"1493\" height=\"430\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/63acee16-a6f5-49b1-b6d0-f9f89ceb228f\" />\r\n\r\nThis allows e.g. using Jolt Physics in 2D. Something like this can be desirable e.g. for stability compared to GodotPhysics2D.\r\n\r\nInternally it just locks the bodies to a plane and adds some thickness to the shapes, etc.\r\n\r\nNeeds some more work, it's still a bit janky ~~and is missing some features like one-way collisions, joints, character bodies~~.\r\n\r\nIn the current state the [2D Physics Platformer Demo](https://github.com/godotengine/godot-demo-projects/tree/master/2d/physics_platformer) and the [2D Platformer Demo](https://github.com/godotengine/godot-demo-projects/tree/master/2d/platformer) are already playable.\r\n\r\n- Closes https://github.com/godotengine/godot-proposals/issues/13313\r\n\r\n*This PR is sponsored by My Spare Time™.*","labels":[{"id":73330066,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2Ng==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/enhancement","name":"enhancement","description":"","color":"aaccff","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":370471880,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwzNzA0NzE4ODA=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:physics","name":"topic:physics","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":2666708059,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNjY2NzA4MDU5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:2d","name":"topic:2d","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":{"id":8237783,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4AfbLX","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/16","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/16","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/16/labels","number":16,"state":"open","title":"4.x","description":"Issues and pull requests slated for an undetermined Godot 4 release.","creator":{"login":"akien-